  "sourceTitle": "Gourmet Meatballs",
  "sourceText": "Gourmet Meatballs\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 12:12am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 lbs. ground meat\n1 1/2 cups bread crumbs (moistened with water)\n1/2 cup minced onion\n2 eggs\n1 teaspoon garlic powder\n1 tablespoon seasoned salt\n1/2 teaspoon pepper\n1 bottle chili sauce\n16 ounces grape jelly (don't use jam)\n1 tablespoon lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Bring the sauce to a boil. Form small meatballs (size of a walnut), drop into boiling sauce. Turn sauce down to simmer for 1 1/2 hours.",
